<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Where Relevance Emerges: A Layer-Wise Study 
<br class="ltx_break">of Internal Attention for Zero-Shot Re-Ranking</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Proceedings of the 49th International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval; July 20–24, 2026; Melbourne, Australia</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">Proceedings of the 49th International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval (SIGIR ’26), July 20–24, 2026, Melbourne, Australia</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>; ; </span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Information systems Retrieval models and ranking</span></span></span>
